# Keen-Eyed Curator exiles one card from a graveyard on each of three turns: a land, an artifact creature and an
# instant, which are four card types among the cards exiled with it. It stays a 3/3 until then and becomes a 7/7
# trampler (CR 610.3). Bot2's discards to hand size supply the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Keen-Eyed Curator
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

